pert Concrete Foundation
time-unit d

# Real-world lag (cure time) + SS overlap (parallel crews). Covers the
# `-Nd->` lag-only shortcut and the `-SS+Nd->` parallel-start form.

dig footings 2 3 5
pour concrete 1 1 2
frame walls 4 6 8
roof 3 4 5
inspect 1 1 1

dig footings
  -> pour concrete
pour concrete
  -3d-> frame walls
frame walls
  -SS+2d-> roof
frame walls
  -> inspect
roof
  -> inspect
